LOCAL12="A device that takes only 16 bit gets triangular dither, so quiet passages and fades stay clean. To switch it off, see the comment in the file named below."
LOCAL13="Your own settings win: put them in ~/.config/pipewire/pipewire.conf.d or ~/.config/wireplumber/wireplumber.conf.d, or in /etc with a file name that sorts after 00-sparky-stereo-audio."
